+
+### Workspace interface
+
+The content-first HUD presents conversation history, copyable code and real
+project/tool-step states alongside local model status. Pending sandbox commands
+have request-bound approve/reject controls; existing permissions and expiry
+checks remain authoritative. The interface supports light/dark themes, keyboard
+focus and reduced-motion preferences. See [interface contracts and validation](docs/hud-workspace-redesign.md).
